OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GThe BBC Philharmonic is joined by
OL,6,     Gsoprano Sarah Wegener for music
OL,7,     Gby Wagner and Strauss. The
OL,8,     Gorchestra gives the UK premiere
OL,9,     Gof Edmund Finnis's The Landscape
OL,10,     GWakes.
OL,11,G2145FThe Essay: Martin Hayes Turns the
OL,12,     FTune
OL,13,     GIn conversation with Olivia
OL,14,     GO'Leary, Martin Hayes describes
OL,15,     Glearning the fiddle as
OL,16,     Gtraditional musicians have for
OL,17,     Gcenturies and regional styles in
OL,18,     Gdifferent parts of Ireland.
