OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 13 APR
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GHannah Peel presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GSoweto is back with another week
OL,12,     Gof the best in jazz, and he
OL,13,     Gwelcomes leading saxophonist Mark
OL,14,     GLockheart as his guest.
OL,15,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,16,     GThe Berlin Radio Chorus joins the
OL,17,     GGerman Symphony Orchestra,
OL,18,     GBerlin, conductor Eva Ollikainen
OL,19,     Gand soloists in Verdi's Requiem.
OL,20,     GPenny Gore presents.
